# Only the website service builds from the repository root (see website/Dockerfile); every
# other service has its own root directory and never reads this file. Keeping the context
# small is what makes that build quick.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
player/app/build
player/.gradle
backend/.venv
frontend/dist
web-player/dist
website/dist
.git
